      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to present this newly refurbished 1 bedroom apartment. Situated within a secure gated development, this bright and modern apartment has been finished to a high standard throughout and offers comfortable, stylish living in a highly convenient location.\n\nThe property features a spacious open plan living - dining area, a fully fitted modern kitchen with new appliances, a large double bedroom with ample storage, and a contemporary bathroom. The apartment also benefits from excellent natural light and quality finishes throughout.\n\nLocated in a well-maintained and secure development, the property is ideally positioned close to the Phoenix Park, TU Dublin Grangegorman, the city centre, and a range of local shops, cafés, and transport links, including multiple bus routes and easy access to the M50.\n\nViewing is by appointment!"
